     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure. Top row: geographic inputs. Bottom row: resulting \
cartogram. Left column uses bare CountryData[\\\"UnitedStates\\\", \
\\\"Polygon\\\"]; right column uses CartogramWL`CountryPolygonRings, which \
splices in the Alaska and Hawaii AdministrativeDivision polygons. The United \
States is highlighted in orange. Every ring of the same country shares the \
country's per-area density.\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
       FontFamily->"Helvetica",
       FontSize->10,
       FontSlant->Italic],
